# The committed MTProto settings are tellomi/server/tellomi-server.json.
# 8.137.39.82:10443 is the production MTProto TCP port, not staging.
# Staging is stated as port 11443 and is not configured. Switching is unconfirmed.
# The build copies the JSON into telegram-ios only after tellomi/apply_mtproto.py
# accepts it. A hostname, an empty RSA key, a missing seed, or port 11443 is refused.

